# Copying two Today entries from a Today pane and pasting them in the outline pane next to it puts copies with their tags after the focused last block, at its depth; p in the Today pane pastes nothing.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1}) @flag
Later:
END
keys <C-w> s gt J y p
keys g1 G p
see - Write report
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1}) @flag
Later:
- Write report @due({today})
- Pay rent @due({today-1}) @flag
END
